# CODEOWNERS — auto-request reviewers for matching files
# Rename .template → CODEOWNERS after SETUP. No file extension.
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners — get review requests on every PR unless overridden below.
*       @{{TEAM_OR_USER}}

# Examples — uncomment and adapt to your tree.
#
# # Frontend
# /apps/web/                    @frontend-team
# /packages/ui/                 @frontend-team
#
# # Backend
# /apps/api/                    @backend-team
# /packages/db/                 @db-owner @backend-team
#
# # Infrastructure / deploys
# /.github/workflows/           @devops-team
# /infra/                       @devops-team
# /Dockerfile                   @devops-team
#
# # Security-sensitive paths
# /apps/api/src/auth/           @security-team @backend-team
# /packages/crypto/             @security-team
#
# # Docs / rules
# /CLAUDE.md                    @{{LEAD_USER}}
# /.claude/rules/               @{{LEAD_USER}}
# /docs/                        @{{LEAD_USER}}

# Notes:
# - Path patterns follow .gitignore syntax.
# - Last matching pattern wins.
# - Owners must have push access to the repo.
# - Combine with branch protection "Require review from Code Owners" for enforcement.
